          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Play Along Tales brings classic fairy tales to life with movement, imagination, and plenty of opportunities for kids to join the adventure. Instead of simply listening, children become part of each story by answering questions, making choices, acting out movements, and helping the characters solve problems along the way.From tiptoeing through a shoemaker’s workshop and outsmarting a giant to swimming beside a little mermaid, dancing with princesses, and joining a woodland orchestra, every tale is filled with playful narration, fun sound effects, and interactive moments that keep young listeners engaged. Kids will stomp, clap, climb, row, waddle, twirl, blow, and imagine as they help each story unfold.Perfect for preschool and early elementary ages, these stories encourage listening, movement, creativity, and problem-solving in a way that feels like play. Whether you’re looking for a screen-free activity at home, a fun car ride companion, or an engaging story time, Play Along Tales invites children to jump right into timeless adventures and become part of the magic from beginning to end.Run Time: 42 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: eb30f17474b6598f77361a8cb8499ad5b669cbabc80c89b283d212cdd01c0ae7",
